Read a `meta` box whose FullBox version is one nobody has defined.

Version 0 is the only `meta` there is; a later one would be a layout this code has never seen, and
reading its children at the offset version 0 puts them at is how a walker parses a table that is
not there. The probe is the fixture whose `meta` claims version 1 — it must be handed to the full
read, which judges the file whole, rather than answered from.

